// PENDING: from an OPEN SigmaHQ pull request. Not reviewed or merged by SigmaHQ yet.
// Pull request: #6668 new: ROMULUS ClickFix delivery platform rules (MSI install, delivery URLs, DeElevate64 Run key, decimal DWORD IP download, Stardock sideload
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6668
// Pull request author: harperjohnsai
// Change: new rule
// Title: Stardock DeElevate Binary Execution From Non-Standard Location
// Sigma ID: 534a4361-51b2-4eca-9bc6-e6b1b4cc0484
// Status: experimental | Level: medium
// Author: Harper Johns
// Date: 2026-11-24 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: persistence, privilege-escalation, execution, stealth, T1574.001
// Description: Detects execution of Stardock's signed `DeElevate64.exe` / `DeElevate.exe` outside the Stardock
//   installation folders in Program Files. Attackers copy the signed host into a user-writable
//   folder (for example `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Stardock Smart DeElevation Tool\`) next to a
//   patched `DeElevator64.dll` so the signed binary side-loads their loader (ROMULUS ClickFix chain,
//   BabaDeda/CNCMachineRMS).
// False positives:
//   - Portable or per-user installations of Stardock products (Fences, Start11, Groupy)
// References:
//   - https://www.huntress.com/blog/chatgpt-custom-gpts-clickfix-rat
//   - https://blackpointcyber.com/blog/romulus-cncmachinerms/
//   - https://hijacklibs.net/entries/3rd_party/stardock/deelevator64.html
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/cd44704e28312f874bfcdfcae656722035f5fc0c/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_stardock_deelevate_non_standard_location.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ((FolderPath endswith "\\DeElevate64.exe" or FolderPath endswith "\\DeElevate.exe") or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "DeElevate.exe") and (not((FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files\\Stardock\\" or FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Stardock\\")))
